  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "34674492",
      "title": "Providing User Feedback via useNavigation",
      "lectureOrder": 25,
      "videoOrder": 21,
      "sourceHash": "c0cc658ca43623f568c431a49dafe567976e173c2ea7b1b84f92ccfb0b7a566e",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.13,
          "end": 5.16,
          "en": "Now, how can we leverage this form component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.16,
          "end": 6.12,
          "en": "besides going back",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.12,
          "end": 9.12,
          "en": "to the single page application experience?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.12,
          "end": 10.5,
          "en": "Well, we could, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 10.5,
          "end": 14.22,
          "en": "disable this button whilst the data is submitted.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 14.22,
          "end": 16.56,
          "en": "That is something you might wanna do on Forms.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 16.56,
          "end": 17.46,
          "en": "You wanna make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 17.46,
          "end": 20.49,
          "en": "that it's not accidentally submitted twice.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 20.49,
          "end": 23.76,
          "en": "And you can easily do that when using this Form component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 23.76,
          "end": 27.45,
          "en": "provided by Remix, by also using another hook.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 27.45,
          "end": 30.39,
          "en": "And that's the Use Navigation hook.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 30.39,
          "end": 32.4,
          "en": "Actually, at the point of time I'm recording this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 32.4,
          "end": 34.2,
          "en": "it's called Use Transition,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 34.2,
          "end": 38.01,
          "en": "but it will be renamed to Use Navigation in a future version",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 38.01,
          "end": 40.83,
          "en": "because Use Transition is a hook that's now also provided",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 40.83,
          "end": 42.063,
          "en": "by React itself.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 43.14,
          "end": 45.6,
          "en": "Therefore, here I'll give it an alias,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 45.6,
          "end": 46.83,
          "en": "and you should simply check",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 46.83,
          "end": 50.1,
          "en": "whether you have a Use Navigation hook you could import,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 50.1,
          "end": 51.51,
          "en": "which you can tell by the fact",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 51.51,
          "end": 52.98,
          "en": "that you get auto completion,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 52.98,
          "end": 54.33,
          "en": "which I don't get here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 54.33,
          "end": 56.28,
          "en": "for a Use Navigation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 56.28,
          "end": 59.22,
          "en": "If you get auto completion for a Use Transition,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 59.22,
          "end": 62.82,
          "en": "I recommend that you also rename it to Use Navigation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 62.82,
          "end": 65.04,
          "en": "so that you already get used to that new name",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 65.04,
          "end": 67.04,
          "en": "which this hook will have in the future.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 68.03999999999999,
          "end": 72.51,
          "en": "Now this hook gives us a navigation object, if we call it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 72.51,
          "end": 75.666,
          "en": "And this navigation object contains some useful data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 75.666,
          "end": 79.68,
          "en": "about ongoing requests that might be happening",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 79.68,
          "end": 82.17,
          "en": "behind the scenes, so to say.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 82.17,
          "end": 85.11,
          "en": "For example, we can access the state property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 85.11,
          "end": 88.02,
          "en": "to find out whether we're currently submitting data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 88.02,
          "end": 89.91,
          "en": "or if we're maybe loading data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 89.91,
          "end": 91.9,
          "en": "or if we're not doing anything.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 91.9,
          "end": 94.953,
          "en": "We can also access the submission property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 94.953,
          "end": 96.6,
          "en": "to get more information",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 96.6,
          "end": 99.39,
          "en": "about the latest form submission that was triggered,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 99.39,
          "end": 102.87,
          "en": "like for example, the path to which the request was sent,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 102.87,
          "end": 106.143,
          "en": "what the method was, or which kind of data was submitted.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 107.00999999999999,
          "end": 108.99000000000001,
          "en": "You can also use the type here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 108.99000000000001,
          "end": 113.00999999999999,
          "en": "to find out whether the last navigation that was performed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 113.00999999999999,
          "end": 115.08,
          "en": "by Remix behind the scenes, so to say,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 115.08,
          "end": 117.03,
          "en": "was maybe that you were redirected",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 117.03,
          "end": 119.13300000000001,
          "en": "because of some action that was called.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 120.57,
          "end": 124.26,
          "en": "And here I'm interested in the state.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 124.26,
          "end": 126.09,
          "en": "I wanna check if we're currently submitting",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 126.09,
          "end": 129.453,
          "en": "and I'll store the result in a Is Submitting constant.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 130.35,
          "end": 133.83,
          "en": "And now I can use this constant to disable this button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 133.83,
          "end": 135.93,
          "en": "by simply binding the disabled prop,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 135.93,
          "end": 138.27,
          "en": "or setting the disabled prop here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 138.27,
          "end": 139.62,
          "en": "to Is Submitting.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 139.62,
          "end": 142.203,
          "en": "If I am submitting, I wanna disable this button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 143.76,
          "end": 145.86,
          "en": "We can also change the label of this button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 145.86,
          "end": 147.69,
          "en": "and check if we are submitting,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 147.69,
          "end": 150.847,
          "en": "in which case we could say \"Adding ...\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 152.37,
          "end": 154.947,
          "en": "And otherwise we say \"Add Note,\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 156.72,
          "end": 161.28,
          "en": "so we can take the current submission status into account.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 161.28,
          "end": 163.11,
          "en": "Now here we won't really see this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 163.11,
          "end": 165.21,
          "en": "because this will be super fast",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 165.21,
          "end": 166.785,
          "en": "since it's all running locally,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 166.785,
          "end": 169.2,
          "en": "but if you would add a new note here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 169.2,
          "end": 171.63,
          "en": "and you're back, it would be slightly slower,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 171.63,
          "end": 173.13,
          "en": "you would see that temporarily",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 173.13,
          "end": 175.11,
          "en": "this button is disabled",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 175.11,
          "end": 176.76,
          "en": "and it's labeled \"Changes.\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 176.76,
          "end": 178.77,
          "en": "Again here, it's just too fast,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 178.77,
          "end": 181.2,
          "en": "since it's all happening on the same machine.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 181.2,
          "end": 183.12,
          "en": "We can see it in action though",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 183.12,
          "end": 187.053,
          "en": "by awaiting a new promise, which I construct here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 188.01,
          "end": 193.01,
          "en": "where I will simply wrap a call to set timeout.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 196.14,
          "end": 199.47,
          "en": "And then when the timeout is done,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 199.47,
          "end": 201.34,
          "en": "simply call Resolve",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 203.85,
          "end": 206.253,
          "en": "and set the timeout to two seconds like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 207.63,
          "end": 209.19,
          "en": "With this line added,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 209.19,
          "end": 211.413,
          "en": "we'll simply add a two second pause here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 213.03,
          "end": 217.32,
          "en": "And if we do that, and I add another note,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 217.32,
          "end": 219.27,
          "en": "you will see that now this is disabled",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 219.27,
          "end": 221.553,
          "en": "and shows adding until it's done.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 223.41,
          "end": 226.11,
          "en": "Now of course, I'll comment this out,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 226.11,
          "end": 228.12,
          "en": "since I don't want this pause anymore,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 228.12,
          "end": 231.63,
          "en": "but that is how you can also leverage this form component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 231.63,
          "end": 233.4,
          "en": "to get this extra information",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 233.4,
          "end": 235.77,
          "en": "and to enhance the user interface",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 235.77,
          "end": 237.84300000000002,
          "en": "based on the current submission status.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
